      "factId": "license-plate-draft-001",
      "topicId": "license_plate",
      "factText": "许多车牌并非普通涂漆金属板，而是在基板上贴逆反射膜，让入射光大致沿原方向返回，并可同时嵌入方向性防伪图案。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-license-plate-retroreflective-security"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "license-plate-draft-002",
      "topicId": "license_plate",
      "factText": "逆反射膜里的防伪标记可以随观察角度改变外观，同时把图案设计在不干扰可见光、红外或逆反射条件下读取字符的位置。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-license-plate-angle-security-mark"],
      "riskLevel": "general",
      "reviewStatus": "draft"
    },
    {
      "factId": "license-plate-draft-003",
      "topicId": "license_plate",
      "factText": "车牌基板可用金属或树脂，贴上逆反射层后再压出凸字或凹字、着色，最后覆盖表面保护层形成完整牌面。",
      "sourceIds": ["src-license-plate-laminated-manufacture"],
